  +s6  -s2  +s2  -s6  -s6  +s2  -s2  +s6
  +s7  -s5  +s3  -s1  +s1  -s3  +s5  -s7
whereas, s0..s7 = scalefactor[0..7], multiplied by sqrt(2) (ie. by 1.414), and
