  050h 10    Subchannel Q (adjusted position values)
  05Ah 2        ...
  05Ch 1     00h (or 64h)
  05Dh 3     MM:SS:FF (current read address) (sticky address during pause)
  060h 1     increments at circa 16Hz or so (or other rate when spinning)
