  1CDh 1     Depends on disk (01 or 02 or 06) (or 00 when no disk)
  1CEh 1     Zero
  1CFh 1     Depends on disk (NULL minus N*6) (or 00 when no disk)
               (maybe reflection level / laser intensity or so)
