  007h 1      max          Note limit maximum value     (Yaroze: 0..127)
  008h 1      vibW                                      (Yaroze: N/A)
  009h 1      vibT                                      (Yaroze: N/A)
  00Ah 1      porW                                      (Yaroze: N/A)
