  004h 4     Group Size-08h (SIZ) (little-endian)
  008h SIZ   Chunk(s)
 Chunk Format:
  000h 4     Chunk Type (4-character ASCII)
  004h 4     Chunk Size (SIZ) (little-endian)
  00Ch SIZ   Data
  ...  ..    Zeropadding to 2-byte boundary
