  004h 4     Chunk Size (SIZ)
  008h SIZ   Chunk Data (eg. SEQ file)
Chunk Type values:
  02h  unknown                      ST*.BIN
  05h  .TXT                         ROLL.BIN
  05h  LZ-compressed TIM            DEMODATA.BIN, ST*.BIN (except ST1*.BIN)
  06h  DOT1 with stuff and TSQ??    ST*.BIN
  07h  .TMD                         DEMODATA.BIN, ST*.BIN (except ST1*.BIN)
