  13-18 3rd character ; Name       ; 0Ah..23h="a..z"
  19-24 2nd character ;            ; 24h..3Dh="A..Z"
  25-30 1st character ;/           ;/3Eh..3Fh="_" and "!"
  31    Always zero?
Special name: 6396347Fh="NONE.!"

