RADIO.DAT:
Whatever, contains chunks with text messages, chunks are about as so:
  000h 4   Unknown    (eg. 36h,BFh,5Eh,00h)
  004h 4   Unknown    (eg. 03h,13h,00h,00h)
  008h 1   Unknown    (eg. 80h)
